                <pb facs="1171" n="1165" xml:id="pg1165"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr. Daggett.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 62.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-08-02"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                        1884</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your dispatch No. 174, of
                    the 14th ultimo, concerning certain important financial proceeding in the
                    Hawaiian legislative assembly, and have forwarded a copy of your dispatch to the
                    Secretary of the Treasury as of possible interest to his Department.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Davis</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
